{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"拓扑学","text":"拓扑学"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Hausdorff空间"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"Hausdorff 空间"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p><strong>Hausdorff 空间</strong>是满足如下条件的"},{"Local":{"url":"拓扑学","text":"拓扑空间"}},{"Plain":" $X$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>任何两个不同的点 $x,y\\in X$ 都被两个不相交的开邻域 $U,V$ 分离 (其中 $U$ 仅包含 $x$, $V$ 仅包含 $y$).</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"对角线","text":"对角线"}},{"Plain":" $\\Delta\\colon X \\to X$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"闭映射","text":"闭映射"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"T4空间","text":"$T_4$ 空间"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}